		},
		{
			"id":"62ca1fab5a9557af",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"i like his old eye more.\n\nAlso I just observed generally , and i noticed the art has lost some of it uniqueness compared to the first few iterations. but i think this is a fine trade as i dont have a lot of time to do art, so copying and learning from already existing yume nikki artstyles seems like the best option.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-382,
			"y":1157,
			"width":260,
			"height":311
		},
		{"id":"8b82f491ea7cfe06","type":"text","text":"make highlights less obvious","x":-1306,"y":1229,"width":250,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"2ad57d62f88b6ef7",
			"type":"text",
